        <mxCell id="matrix" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;align=left;spacingLeft=14;fontSize=13" value="Plane-1：历史已完成；V3.0-PhaseA~E 回归保护；V3.x+ Web/Video UI 前置&lt;br&gt;Plane-2：V3.0-PhaseA scope params 主改动；PhaseB/C/D/E 受 RPC 合同影响；V3.x+ SDK/低代码协议&lt;br&gt;Plane-3：V3.0-PhaseA ScopeContext 主改动；PhaseC Job/Artifact/Governance 主改动；PhaseD/E 验证 reference pack 复用能力；V3.x+ Memory/Feedback&lt;br&gt;Plane-4：V3.0-PhaseC RuntimeAdapter governance 主改动；PhaseD/E 执行链路验证；V3.x+ 多 runtime 扩展&lt;br&gt;Plane-5：V3.0-PhaseB PackAssemblyResult 主改动；PhaseD Meeting reference pack；PhaseE Knowledge reference pack；V3.x+ Interview/Investment/Video/Low-Code&lt;br&gt;Plane-6：V3.0-PhaseA scope migration、PhaseB connector security、PhaseC artifact/job policy、PhaseD/E MCP connectors；V3.x+ 外部 store/GPU/视频工具" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="210" width="1820" x="90" y="1100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="plan_header" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1" value="V3.0 详细开发计划" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="900" x="60" y="1380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="plan_text" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=13;arcSize=5;" value="PhaseA 专项文件：&lt;br&gt;docs/design/V3.0/v3_phasea_multi_app_core_readiness.md&lt;br&gt;docs/design/V3.0/v3_phasea_multi_app_core_readiness_acceptance.md&lt;br&gt;PhaseB 专项文件：&lt;br&gt;docs/design/V3.0/v3_phaseb_pack_connector_registry.md&lt;br&gt;本图保留执行视图摘要；PhaseA/PhaseB 的详细实施边界以专项文件为准。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseA：Multi-App Core Readiness&lt;br&gt;状态：COMPLETED / FROZEN BASELINE（2026-05-06）&lt;br&gt;目标：冻结 AppProfile -&gt; ScopeContext -&gt; Gateway/Core service -&gt; Store 主链路&lt;br&gt;当前事实：resolver、session 查询隔离、命名 migration/backfill 和 namespace fixture 已落地；2026-05-06 已重新完成前检查 + 默认主线 + 真实音频验收；显式真实音频在 .venv + backend/venv312 基线下通过&lt;br&gt;变更控制：后续仅允许缺陷修复、证据追加和文档校正，不得被新规格直接覆写&lt;br&gt;A1 profiles；A2 resolver/RPC scope；A3 records scope；A4 Store filtering；A5 migration/backfill；A6 isolation + meeting regression&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseB：Pack 装配与 Connector 注册表&lt;br&gt;状态：COMPLETED / PHASE CLOSEOUT BASELINE（2026-05-08）&lt;br&gt;目标：冻结 PackAssemblyResult 与 ConnectorRegistry / Connector Security Model 合同，并推进平台去定制化&lt;br&gt;当前事实：AppProfile pack_paths 已落地；assembly 输入已开始从 app_registry + connector_registry 推导，并会按 shared-domain 合并 enabled connectors；connector availability 由 registry 决定，AppProfile 只负责 enabled refs；未启用 connector 会返回 app_profile_connector blocked dependency；external pack 缺 target_version 为 degraded，不兼容为 blocked；workflow registration 已优先走 pack entrypoint；built-in connector 已开始走 descriptor definition 注册路径，local.knowledge 已补为 contract stub；2026-05-08 已完成平台链路 15 passed + preflight/FunASR/Data Service/Meeting-&gt;Knowledge 显式验收&lt;br&gt;B1：Pack manifest schema&lt;br&gt;B2：PackAssemblyResult 合同&lt;br&gt;B3：冲突与缺失依赖处理&lt;br&gt;B4：external pack paths&lt;br&gt;B5：connector descriptor / security&lt;br&gt;B6：meeting / knowledge assembly&lt;br&gt;B7：descriptor-driven workflow registration&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseC：Job / Artifact / Governance Hardening&lt;br&gt;状态：ACTIVE NEXT PHASE&lt;br&gt;C1 job state；C2 artifact external/lineage fields；C3 large-file policy；C4 policy hooks；C5 adapter governance injection；C6 platform-neutral governance audit&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseD：Meeting reference pack validation&lt;br&gt;D1 meeting manifest；D2 Meeting/FunASR registry；D3 real audio Pack workflow；D4 legacy facade adapter；D5 lineage/equivalence&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseE：Knowledge reference pack validation&lt;br&gt;E1 knowledge manifest；E2 data_service_mcp registry；E3 ingest/search/summarize/citation；E4 data boundary；E5 connector replacement fixture" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="740" width="900" x="60" y="1450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="accept_header" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1" value="V3.0 验收里程碑" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="900" x="1040" y="1380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="accept_text" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=13;arcSize=3;" value="V3.0-PhaseA：AC01 profiles；AC02 scope 隔离；AC03 legacy 回填；AC04 RPC scope；AC05 meeting 回归&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseB-AC01：Pack manifest schema&lt;br&gt;标准：workflow、skill、connector、policy bundle、artifact kind 可声明并通过 registry 校验&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseB-AC02：PackAssemblyResult&lt;br&gt;标准：pack.list/get 返回 assembled / blocked / degraded / stub、missing_dependencies、conflicts、next_actions&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseB-AC03：External pack paths&lt;br&gt;标准：外部 pack 可加载；版本不兼容时返回 blocked&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseB-AC04：Connector Registry&lt;br&gt;标准：connector.list/get/health 通过 registry 暴露 capabilities、health、config_ref、secret_ref、app_scope&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseB-AC05：Connector security&lt;br&gt;标准：未 allowlist 的 stdio command/path/network 被 blocked&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseB-AC06：sample-pack neutrality&lt;br&gt;标准：新增 sample pack 的发现、装配、注册与执行不需要修改 Core/Gateway 业务逻辑&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseB-AC07：descriptor-driven assembly&lt;br&gt;标准：sample connector 可通过 descriptor definition 注入，而不是固定业务常量集合&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseC：AC01 job 状态；AC02 大文件策略；AC03 lineage；AC04 治理覆盖；AC05 meeting 回归；AC06 platform-neutral governance&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseD：AC01 真实音频；AC02 legacy 等价；AC03 lineage；AC04 硬编码路径清理；AC06 无新增平台业务旁路&lt;br&gt;V3.0-PhaseE：AC01 data_service_mcp E2E；AC02 数据边界；AC03 connector 替换；AC04 citation artifacts；AC05 lineage；AC06 无新增平台业务旁路&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;PhaseB 收官证据（2026-05-08）：平台链路 15 passed；check_real_mcp_env status=ok；FunASR/Data Service/Meeting-&gt;Knowledge 显式验收均为 status=ok&lt;br&gt;默认回归：stub / contract mode，2026-05-06 为 161 passed / 1 skipped / 2 deselected&lt;br&gt;PhaseA 状态：已完成并冻结；后续阶段不得删除或弱化其基线测试与验收项&lt;br&gt;PhaseA 辅助验收基线：v3_phasea_multi_app_core_readiness_acceptance.md" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="740" width="900" x="1040" y="1450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
